8. INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

❓ Is an array a primitive data type in Java?

✘ No.

✔ Array is an Object (Reference Type).

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Can Object[] store different objects?

✔ Yes.

It can store any Java object.

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Why is array access O(1)?

✔ Direct address calculation using index.

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Why is searching O(n)?

✔ Index is unknown, so traversal is required.

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Why are arrays contiguous?

✔ To support direct address calculation and improve cache performance.

------------------------------------------------------------

❓ Is insertion at the end always O(1)?

✔ O(1) only if free space exists.
If the array is full, a new larger array must be created and elements copied.

